@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam classBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam classHeaderBackgroundColor #DFF1EF
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam activityBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #DFF1EF
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #458F88
skinparam padding 6
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 40
hide empty members
title System Analysis — iterative working route
start
:Read accepted scope, current requirements
and decision status;
:Maintain system context
(roles, exchanges, exclusions);
repeat
:Refine domain concepts and conceptual data;
:Develop the relevant functional
and behavioral views;
:State constraints and operation contracts;
:Check sources, cross-view agreement
and actual findings;
repeat while (Unresolved model inconsistency?) is (yes) not (no)
:Prepare identified design-handoff candidate
with explicit dependent gates;
note right
A reviewed candidate is not automatically
an accepted phase baseline.
Return to the primary requirement only
when its meaning actually needs refinement.
end note
stop
@enduml
